    "Name": "Skyraider",
    "Details": "A monster of a unit, these heavily armed VTOLs are the epitome of the Gunship. Line breakers and fire support platforms, these are usually found in the front of an attack. Packing a potent array of heavy weapons, the Assault VTOL can shred any target it encounters.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 6/9 hexes / 180/270 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Light Ferro\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       160     30\n<b>Left</b>         145     30\n<b>Right</b>       145     30\n<b>Rear</b>        115     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      590    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color>",
